#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add an operation to the back {#add-an-operation-to-the-back}"
msgstr "Añadir una operación al final {#add-an-operation-to-the-back}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An operation is added to the end of the DAGCircuit using the "
"`apply_operation_back()` method. This appends the specified gate to act on "
"the given qubits after all existing operations in the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Se añade una operación al final del DAGCircuit usando el método "
"`apply_operation_back()`. Esto añade la puerta especificada para que actúe "
"sobre los qubits dados después de todas las operaciones existentes en el "
"circuito.\n"

